Upstream attribution:

This package contains TypeScript code translated from the C source at
https://github.com/lenniea/fletcher (fletcher.c, fletcher.h), MIT License.

Algorithm: Fletcher's checksum (Fletcher 1982); RFC 1146 §C standardises
Fletcher-16 for TCP options.
